{"miesto":"proof:p-dim3","otazka":"Prečo stačí ukázať, že súbor generuje P? Ukáž mi presné znenie vety zo skrípt, o ktorú sa to opiera.","fotky":0,"zastavene":false,"text":"Stačí ukázať, že súbor generuje $P$, lebo **lineárnu nezávislosť už máš v predpoklade**. Podľa definície je báza lineárne nezávislý súbor, ktorý generuje daný priestor. V dôkaze teda zostáva overiť iba generovanie.\n\nPresné znenie zo skrípt:\n\n<veta cislo=\"Věta 2.55\"\/>\n\nVěta 2.55 hovorí aj viac: ak má súbor vektorov z $P$ presne $\\dim P$ prvkov, potom byť bázou, byť lineárne nezávislý a generovať $P$ sú rovnocenné podmienky. Na papieri však dokazuješ práve jeden smer tejto vety, takže záver opri o **definíciu bázy**, nie o samotnú Větu 2.55.","nastroje":["tvrdenie"],"udalosti":[{"t":7,"e":"reset"},{"t":7,"e":"stav","d":"Premýšľam"},{"t":2790,"e":"stav","d":"Hľadám vetu v skriptách"},{"t":2798,"e":"reset"},{"t":2798,"e":"stav","d":"Píšem odpoveď"},{"t":5615,"e":"stav","d":""},{"t":5615,"e":"text","d":"Sta"},{"t":5615,"e":"text","d":"čí"},{"t":5616,"e":"text","d":" uk"},{"t":5616,"e":"text","d":"á"},{"t":5616,"e":"text","d":"za"},{"t":5616,"e":"text","d":"ť"},{"t":5882,"e":"text","d":","},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":" že"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":" sú"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":"bor"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":" gener"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":"uje"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":" $"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":"P"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":"$,"},{"t":5883,"e":"text","d":" le"},{"t":6038,"e":"text","d":"bo"},{"t":6038,"e":"text","d":" **"},{"t":6038,"e":"text","d":"line"},{"t":6038,"e":"text","d":"ár"},{"t":6038,"e":"text","d":"nu"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":" nez"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":"á"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":"vis"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":"los"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":"ť"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":" už"},{"t":6197,"e":"text","d":" má"},{"t":6452,"e":"text","d":"š"},{"t":6452,"e":"text","d":" v"},{"t":6452,"e":"text","d":" pred"},{"t":6452,"e":"text","d":"pok"},{"t":6452,"e":"text","d"